	(descr "Vishay VCNL4040M3OE ALS + proximity sensor with IR emitter, 4.0x2.0x1.1mm SMD-8. Land pattern per datasheet Rev 2.0 Fig.15 (0.7x0.725mm pads, 1.4mm column spacing, 1.075mm row pitch). Optical apertures on top face, both marked on F.Fab: ALS/PS sensor window D1.1mm (near pins 1/8) and IR emitter window D1.2mm (near pins 4/5). Keep the optical path above both windows clear: no silkscreen, mask ink, adhesive, or enclosure obstruction over the windows (same keep-clear rule as an acoustic port). Rebuilt from datasheet; EasyEDA C142526 land pattern not used (non-standard 2.08mm column spacing).")
